{{Quote|This light armor features state-of-the-art synthetic adaptive fibers and light-diffusing scrim netting, enabling its wearer to blend seamlessly into any wilderness, and carry out unannounced compliance audits with as much surprise as they deem appropriate.|[[Armory]] description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[Armor#Light-0|light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the [[Armor#Armor-0|armor]] and [[Armor#Helmet-0|helmet]] can be claimed on page 1 of the [[Scope of Authority Premium Warbond#Page 1|Scope of Authority Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and {{Currency|Medals|30}}, respectively.

