== Trivia ==
* The [[SS-15 Focal Point]], [[SS-500 Pale Prosecutor]], and SS-33 Mimetic Marshal are the first armor sets to include "Interactive Adaptive Camouflage." This means that the color and pattern of the armor's camouflage will change depending on the wearer's current [[Biomes|biome]]. 
** It is unknown if the Interactive Adaptive Camouflage has any effect on enemy detection range, outside of the {{Passive|Stationary Shroud}} armor passive.
